comments.body:
@lebaphi - I welcome @ShendMikullovci contributing his thoughts on this user interaction.

A _playable_ version of the above wargame is here:  https://serge-review.herokuapp.com/?wargame=wargame-kqgy546g&access=pkoiqu5ev

I have a _slight_ worry that the dark blue circle is a small click target, plus is a "hidden interaction" - there aren't any visual clues that the user can mark as unread by clicking it.  We _could_ include this guidance in the intro walkthrough - but I feel we can't rely on that.
